#ASSERT `s 150(4)(b) the same applies to the person nominated by the member` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 150(5)(a) the rights conferred by the nomination are in addition to the rights of the member himself` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 150(5)(a) the rights conferred by the nomination are in addition to the rights of the member himself` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
