    PARTY Member DOES `s 152(3) the member informs the company of the ways in which he is exercising the rights` AT 0
-- s 152(4): arguments (exercises such rights) (has informed the company that he is not exercising all his rights) (has informed the company that he is exercising them in different ways)
#ASSERT `s 152(4) the company is entitled to assume that the member is exercising all his rights and is exercising them in the same way` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 152(4) the company is entitled to assume that the member is exercising all his rights and is exercising them in the same way` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 152(4) the company is entitled to assume that the member is exercising all his rights and is exercising them in the same way` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 152(4) the company is entitled to assume that the member is exercising all his rights and is exercising them in the same way` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152(4) the company is entitled to assume that the member is exercising all his rights and is exercising them in the same way` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- s 153(1): the five sections ----
#ASSERT `s 153(1) this section applies for the purposes of the section` `s 153(1)(a) section 314 (power to require circulation of statement)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(1) this section applies for the purposes of the section` `s 153(1)(b) section 338 (public companies: power to require circulation of resolution for AGM)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(1) this section applies for the purposes of the section` `s 153(1)(ba) section 338A (traded companies: members' power to include matters in business dealt with at AGM)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(1) this section applies for the purposes of the section` `s 153(1)(c) section 342 (power to require independent report on poll)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(1) this section applies for the purposes of the section` `s 153(1)(d) section 527 (power to require website publication of audit concerns)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(1) this section applies for the purposes of the section` `s 153(1) another section` EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 153(2)(a): "at least 100 persons"
#ASSERT `s 153(2)(a) the request is made by at least 100 persons` 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(2)(a) the request is made by at least 100 persons` 99 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 153(2)(a) the request is made by at least 100 persons` 1000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 153(2)(f): "the total amount of the sums paid up ... divided by the number of persons making the request, is not less than £100": arguments (persons) (total pounds)
#ASSERT `s 153(2)(f) the total paid up divided by the number of persons making the request is not less than 100 pounds` 100 10000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(2)(f) the total paid up divided by the number of persons making the request is not less than 100 pounds` 100 9999 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 153(2)(f) the total paid up divided by the number of persons making the request is not less than 100 pounds` 150 15000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(2)(f) the total paid up divided by the number of persons making the request is not less than 100 pounds` 150 14999 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 153(2)(f) the total paid up divided by the number of persons making the request is not less than 100 pounds` 0 5000 EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 153(2): a request, fields in order: persons; authenticated; (c)(i) to (c)(vii); (d)(i); (d)(ii); evidence; total paid up in pounds; other requirements
#ASSERT `s 153(2) the company is required to act under the section on the request` (`s 153(2) request` OF 100, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 10000, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(2) the company is required to act under the section on the request` (`s 153(2) request` OF 99, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 9900, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 153(2) the company is required to act under the section on the request` (`s 153(2) request` OF 100, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 10000, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(2) the company is required to act under the section on the request` (`s 153(2) request` OF 100, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 9999, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
